<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE OKS 20BLN DRS, 5-YR EBRD BOND.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE OKS 20BLN DRS, 5-YR EBRD BOND.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athens stock exchange authorities gave the green light to a five-year, 10.25 percent EBRD bond worth 20 billion drachmas, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bond will be listed on the Athens bourse pending the final approval of the capital markets commission. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
